+# RSpec Suite Optimization Notes
+
+## Baseline (2026-10-06, before models optimization)
+
+- Command: `bundle exec rspec spec/models --profile 20`
+- Result: **1795 examples, 0 failures, Finished in 2 minutes 42.5 seconds** (files took 2.62s to load)
+- Seed: 31864
+- Environment: Ruby 4.0.6, Rails test env, PostgreSQL 17, Redis 6379, no parallelization, CI=eager_load false locally.
+
